{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21734","headline":"酬乐天余思不尽加爲六韵之作 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天余思不尽加爲六韵之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"律吕同声我尔身，文章君是一伶伦。\n衆推贾谊爲才子，帝喜相如作侍臣。\n次韵千言曾报荅，直词三道共经纶。\n元诗駮杂真难辨，白朴流传用转新。\n蔡女图书虽在口，于公门户岂生尘。\n商瞿未老犹希冀，莫把籝金便付人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21734.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21734","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}